            "comments": [
                {
                    "file": "src/nvidia-gpu/Inventory.hpp",
                    "line": 61,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Harshit Aghera",
                        "email": "haghera@nvidia.com",
                        "username": "harshit-aghera"
                    },
                    "message": "Let's create this interface in the class where it is supposed to be updated similar to other MCTP VDM Command."
                },
                {
                    "file": "src/nvidia-gpu/Inventory.hpp",
                    "line": 61,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Eric Liu",
                        "email": "liuer@nvidia.com",
                        "username": "liuer-sys"
                    },
                    "message": "Done. Moved OperatingConfig interface and OperatingSpeed property out of Inventory class into a new dedicated NvidiaGpuOperatingSpeed class, following the same pattern as NvidiaGpuMemoryDevice.\n\nSee PS10: https://gerrit.openbmc.org/c/openbmc/dbus-sensors/+/87801/10/src/nvidia-gpu/NvidiaGpuOperatingSpeed.hpp https://gerrit.openbmc.org/c/openbmc/dbus-sensors/+/87801/10/src/nvidia-gpu/NvidiaGpuOperatingSpeed.cpp"
                },
                {
                    "file": "src/nvidia-gpu/NvidiaGpuDevice.cpp",
                    "line": 227,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Harshit Aghera",
                        "email": "haghera@nvidia.com",
                        "username": "harshit-aghera"
                    },
                    "message": "We should put this in a separate Class similar to other MCTP VDM Commands."
                },
                {
                    "file": "src/nvidia-gpu/NvidiaGpuDevice.cpp",
                    "line": 227,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Eric Liu",
                        "email": "liuer@nvidia.com",
                        "username": "liuer-sys"
                    },
                    "message": "Done. Moved the entire GetCurrentClockFrequency MCTP VDM pipeline (encode, send, decode, D-Bus update) into NvidiaGpuOperatingSpeed::update() and processResponse(). GpuDevice now only holds a shared_ptr and calls update() in read().\n\nSee PS10: https://gerrit.openbmc.org/c/openbmc/dbus-sensors/+/87801/10/src/nvidia-gpu/NvidiaGpuOperatingSpeed.cpp https://gerrit.openbmc.org/c/openbmc/dbus-sensors/+/87801/10/src/nvidia-gpu/NvidiaGpuDevice.cpp"
                }
            ],
